## How to Ask for It at the Salon

Ask a nail tech for a sheer mocha or soap nail finish on an oval shape, not simply "nude nails," since that generic request usually produces an opaque polish rather than the translucent effect you actually want. Naming the specific finish is the difference between walking out with Hadid's look and walking out with a standard salon nude.

Bring a reference photo if you can. Nail technicians see dozens of variations on "nude" in a single day, and a photo removes any guessing about how sheer, warm, and glossy you want the result. Mention the shape too: oval, medium length. A technician defaulting to almond or square will produce a technically nice manicure that still misses <strong>bella hadid clean girl nude nails</strong> specifically.

