## The Best Shade for Your Skin Tone

The right nude for clean girl nails is not one universal shade, it is whichever sheer tone sits closest to your own skin's natural undertone, since the entire look depends on the polish blending rather than contrasting. Hadid's warm mocha works because it matches her own skin tone closely. Copying that exact bottle onto a cooler or deeper complexion can read chalky, ashy, or oddly pink, the opposite of the effortless effect the whole trend is built around.

Warmer, golden undertones generally suit mocha and caramel-leaning sheers, close to what Hadid wears. Cooler, pink undertones look better in a rosier sheer nude. Deeper skin tones often need a richer sheer, closer to translucent chestnut than pale beige, since a too-light polish can look chalky rather than glassy.

